	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you’ve gained some skill in press ganging. When striking a target that is unaware of your hostile intent and attempting to attack them in a nonlethal manner, you deal additional damage equal to your level. If this damage would make your target bloodied, or if they are already bloodied, they must make a Constitution save or be rendered [[/condition id=unconscious]] for 1 minute.</p>",
